<title>POLAND: TONSIL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN SEPTEMBER.</title>
<headline>TONSIL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN SEPTEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.23 vs   0.04 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.30 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.35 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Sales		    6.18 vs   5.38</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.07 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.14 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.91 vs   2.96</p>
<p> Sales		   45.30 vs  39.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish loudspeaker maker is Tonsil SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
